<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan styrene monomer up on price hopes.</title>
<headline>Taiwan styrene monomer up on price hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's two styrene monomer makers Taiwan Styrene Monomer and Grand Petrochemical rose in late Friday trade on expected price rises for the petrochemical product, brokers said.</p>
<p>With 32 minutes left, Taiwan Styrene was up 40 cents, or 1.13 percent, to T$35.9 and Grand Petrochemical gained, 30 cents or 1.13 percent, to T$27, while the overall market index had fallen 0.29 percent.</p>
</text>
